description: Prohibits hardcoded strings and magic values in screen integration code.
globs: src/screens/**/*,src/utils/**/*
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Hardcoded Values in Integration

## 1. Strings & Labels
- ❌ Never write inline UI strings: `<NoData message="No items found" />`.
- ✅ Always use strings from `constant`: `<NoData message={STRINGS.EMPTY.ITEMS} />`.

## 2. Test Identifiers
- Include semantic `testID` attributes on `<Loader />`, `<ScreenErrorState />`, and `<LegendList />`.
